#!/usr/bin/python3
"""repackd: on-demand apt -> dnf repo shim.

Serves a localhost dnf repo per recipe. When dnf asks for
<recipe>/repodata/repomd.xml, the upstream signed apt repo is checked, and if
the package version changed the .deb is verified, repackaged into an RPM,
signed with a local key and added to the repo. Everything else is static.
"""
